SUMMARY:IEEE PES T&D 2026: Tutorial proposal (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE PES Transmission and Distribution Conference and Expositio
 n (IEEE PES T&D 2026)\n\nTutorial proposal: 6 Jun 2025\, 23:59 UTC+12 (ass
 umed)\n\nConference: May 4-7\, 2026\nLocation: Chicago\, USA\nVenue: McCor
 mick Place\n\nAll dates:\n  Tutorial proposal: 6 Jun 2025\, 23:59 UTC+12 (
 assumed)\n  Panel proposals to technical committee chairs: 1 Aug 2025\, 23
 :59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Submission deadline for papers\, presentations and
  panels: 14 Aug 2025\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Notifications delivered: 
 4 Nov 2025\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no timez
 one. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so
  the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it.\n\n
 Themed "Powering Reliability\, Engineering Resilience". The submission sit
 e opened on 10 July 2025. A separate call-for-papers page gave 28 August 2
 025 for papers\; the 14 August date from the call for participation is rec
 orded here.\n\nCall for papers: https://ieeet-d.org/\nDetails: https://lan
 gestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/pes-td26
LOCATION:Chicago\, USA
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ieeet-d.org/
CATEGORIES:Transmission,Distribution,Power Systems,Protection & Automation
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
